      "releaseNotes": "4.0.1. Updated the save score database upgrade to be more stable. If you experience issues with saving scores, try deleting and reinstalling the app. \n\nNew user interface! \n- A sleek new visual design\n- Input data persists when navigating throughout the app until you either reset the page or restart the app\n- Share your scores with friends or save them for tracking your fitness journey\n- View historical test trends\n- Improved input validation and usability\n- Added compliance with Air Force BCA exemptions, including BFA pass/fail\n- Added warning tracking to the HAMR Helper, which will automatically stop after 3 consecutive warnings and display the last completed shuttle\n- Added additional functionality to the DAFMAN/SPFMAN and score chart pages to allow searching the PDFs or jumping straight to the page you need\n- Numerous other performance improvements, bug fixes, and stability enhancments",
